ill every square of “{name}”.":"Täitke \"{name}\" iga ruut.","Time limit {time}.":"Ajapiirang {time}.","At most {n} flagged mistakes.":"Maksimaalselt {n} märgitud viga.","Only {n} checks available.":"Saadaval on ainult {n} tšekid.","Local replay verification failed — score will not be submitted.":"Kohaliku taasesituse kontrollimine ebaõnnestus – skoori ei esitata.","That letter is locked — it was confirmed or revealed.":"See kiri on lukus – see kinnitati või avalikustati.","That square is not part of the grid.":"See ruut ei ole ruudustiku osa.","Only letters A–Z can be entered.":"Sisestada saab ainult tähti A–Z.","Action already applied.":"Tegevus on juba rakendatud.","Action arrived out of order.":"Tegevus saabus valest järjekorrast.","No checks left for this round.":"Selle vooru jaoks pole tšekke jäänud.","That square is already empty.":"See ruut on juba tühi.","That letter is already correct.":"See kiri on juba õige.","Unknown action.":"Tundmatu tegevus.","The round is over.":"Voor on läbi.","Unknown check scope.":"Tundmatu kontrolli ulatus.","No such word.":"Seda sõna pole.","Invalid action: {reason}":"Kehtetu tegevus: {reason}","Word complete: {number} {dir} (streak {streak})":"Sõna lõpetatud: {number} {dir} (rida {streak})","{n} wrong letters flagged.":"{n} valed tähed märgistatud.","{n} wrong letter flagged.":"{n} on märgitud vale täht.","30 seconds left!":"Jäänud 30 sekundit!","30 seconds left.":"Jäänud 30 sekundit.","Row {r} column {c}":"Rida {r} veerg {c}","empty":"tühi","letter {ch}":"täht {ch}","confirmed":"kinnitatud","revealed":"selgus","wrong":"vale","starts clue {n}":"alustab vihjet {n}","Grid {rows} by {cols}. {correct} of {total} letters correct. {words} of {entries} words complete.":"Grid {rows} firmalt {cols}. {correct} ja {total} tähed õiged. {words} {entries} sõnadest on valmis.","Nothing to reveal — the grid is complete.":"Pole midagi paljastada – ruudustik on valmis.","Give up this round? It will count as a loss.":"Kas loobuda sellest voorust